{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In this demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a complex Challenge that covers all the basics and gives you a taste of the deeper mechanics of Shuffle Farm. You can even try out a variety of game-altering Mutators that spice things up! Perfect if you're in the mood for some varied and chaotic madness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Draw your cards. Plant your crops. Cast your spells. Pay the tribute. Survive the cycle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve been chosen - or cursed - by a mysterious divine entity. Their arcane magic shifts the rules. Channel these powers to find synergies between all the different cards (Crops, Buildings, Animals, Arcane), create complex products, and reap the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747960/extras/GIFArcaneCropsFinal.gif?t=1748568291\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">When life gives you crops and magic... make jalape\u00f1o hotdogs!. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747960/extras/GIFSuperPanchoFinal.gif?t=1748568291\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Loyal Companion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're not alone. A clever companion is at your bidding - offering help, and occasionally unleashing destruction and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747960/extras/GIFCompanion2.gif?t=1748568291\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747960?t=1748568291","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747960?t=1748568291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747960/1151accc6d13610d67a47565e942fe670d238414/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748568291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.